# Root-context ignore for web/Dockerfile (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore).
# Ignore everything, re-include the build inputs, then exclude sensitive names.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/**
!apps/web/**
!web
!web/nginx.template.conf
**/*env*
**/*secret*
**/*cred*
**/*token*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/out
**/.git
**/.cache
**/*.log
